的时间点。\n    53→4. 用户点击\"向下箭头\"收起播放页，返回迷你播放器。\n    54→5. 迷你播放器上显示的播放进度时间应与跳转后的实际播放位置保持同步；持续播放时，时间继续正常递增。\n    55→\n</file>\n<metadata>The file has 55 lines in total.</metadata>","metadata":{"relativePath":"spec/requirement.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/spec/requirement.md","resolution":"absolute","endLine":55,"startLine":1,"totalLines":55}}},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01UW9zi9yR9qzyCnaVG3KPxw","type":"TOOL","toolName":"read_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/spec/metadata.json"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"<file>\n     1→{\n     2→  \"base_commit\": \"00b3d8f4f471f31f024860c8d6dbac5df3f27756\",\n     3→  \"baseline_bundle\": \"repo_bundles/cloudmusic-harmonyosnex-00b3d8f4f4-base.bundle\"\n     4→}\n     5→\n</file>\n<metadata>The file has 5 lines in total.</metadata>","metadata":{"relativePath":"spec/metadata.json","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/spec/metadata.json","resolution":"absolute","endLine":5,"startLine":1,"totalLines":5}}}]},{"id":"6ad4e880c14d51690802f01f","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":6699},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"c470112a-4cf9-40cf-86d0-c9873b598bb1","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"I need to produce acceptance.md and baseline-notes.md, so first I should explore the codebase, build and install the app, and read through 1-do.md, the README, and the common directory guidance. I also want to check the referenced website for any relevant technical Q&A before diving into other spec files.\n\n","startTime":1792338053713,"lastModifiedTime":1792338054504},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01Wzka1xDybmJCxxQVSF4uLP","type":"TOOL","toolName":"read_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/spec/1-do.md"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:27f93030c8ccfe919d8a85115a509aa0f8d5029500c05287081d7cf64c0fbba4","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLengt