nged, I should correct that line briefly while answering the question — it's a small, low-risk fix that keeps the documentation accurate.\n\n","startTime":1792374528350,"lastModifiedTime":1792374532538},{"id":"565adda3-1348-4f91-9ccb-764483cf7d2e","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"在 App 的\"设置 → 自定义API服务器地址\"里填 **`http://10.0.2.2:3000`**。\n\n| 地址 | 适用场景 | 检测结果 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `http://127.0.0.1:3000` | 只在本机用（curl、浏览器） | HTTP 200 |\n| `http://10.0.2.2:3000` | 模拟器里的 App 用，**推荐**。这是官方技术答疑给的写法，换网络也不会变 | 模拟器能 ping 通；模拟器上没有 curl/nc，HTTP 请求没测 |\n| `http://172.24.16.249:3000` | 模拟器也能用，是电脑当前的局域网 IP | 本机访问 HTTP 200，模拟器能 ping 通（很慢）；换网络后 IP 会变 |\n| `http://192.168.1.97:3000` | App 里现在保存的就是这个 | **已经不通**：本机 curl 超时，模拟器 ping 不通 |\n\ndocker 容器 `netease_cloud_music_api` 现在正常运行，端口映射是 `0.0.0.0:3000->3000`。\n\n电脑的 IP 从 `192.168.1.97` 换成了 `172.24.16.249`，所以 App 里那个地址失效了。我前面在 [`spec/baseline-notes.md`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/spec/baseline-notes.md) §7 写的\"192.168.1.97 能用\"已经过时。需要的话，我可以把文档里这一行改成 `10.0.2.2`；也可以在模拟器的设置页把地址改过去，再搜一次确认能通。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1792374532864},{"id":"fedadf16-c2ba-4562-be42-36a8896cdee9","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"先在模拟器验证一下，如果能用，再把文档改了","payload":{"query":"先在模拟器验证一下，如果能用，再把文档改了","rawMessage":"先在模拟器验证一下，如果能用，再把文档改了","model":{"displayName":"opus 5.5","modelId":"Opus 5.5_143_69ecd21d3a3e213032bd925cfe9637c5","requestType":"COMATE_MULTIPLE_MODE","mode":"MAX","effort":"xhigh"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Agent","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"spec/acceptance.md","name":"acceptance.md","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"d29a7a3a-82fa-4cf4-a153-9bbd17638451","requestedAt":1792374660043,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false}},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":7100828,"taskId":12285309,"capabilityS