92375302993},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01SScMTKcdyoeykbJ8i2ZPxP","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"cd /Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/logs && export PATH=/Applications/DevEco-Studio.app/Contents/sdk/default/openharmony/toolchains:$PATH && hdc -t 127.0.0.1:5555 shell \"hilog -r\" >/dev/null 2>&1; ../../common/.venv/bin/python - 2>&1 <<'EOF' | grep -v -E \"^\\[20|^\\]$\"\nimport time\nfrom hypium import UiDriver, BY\nd = UiDriver.connect(device_sn=\"127.0.0.1:5555\")\nfor _ in range(3):\n    if d.find_component(BY.text(\"登录账号\\n以显示你的歌单\")): break\n    d.press_back(); d.wait(1.5)\nti = d.find_component(BY.type(\"TextInput\"))\nd.input_text(ti, \"晴天\"); d.wait(0.5); d.press_back(); d.wait(0.5)\nd.click([x for x in d.find_all_components(BY.type(\"Button\")) if 850 < x.getBounds().left < 1000 and x.getBounds().top < 450][0])\nt0 = time.time()\nwhile time.time() - t0 < 20 and not d.find_component(BY.text('\"晴天\" 的搜索结果')): d.wait(0.5)\nd.wait(2)\nd.click(d.find_component(BY.text(\"Lucky小爱\"))); d.wait(2)\nd.click(d.find_component(BY.text(\"播放\"))); d.wait(8)\ntop = [x for x in d.find_all_components(BY.type(\"Button\")) if x.getBounds().left > 1050 and x.getBounds().top < 300]\nd.click(top[-1]); d.wait(1.5)\nread = lambda: [t.getText() for t in d.find_all_components(BY.type(\"Text\")) if \"/\" in (t.getText() or \"\") and \":\" in (t.getText() or \"\")]\ns = []\nfor i in range(3):\n    s.append((round(time.time() - t0, 1), read())); d.wait(4)\nprint(\"samples:\", s)\nd.press_back()\nEOF\nhdc -t 127.0.0.1:5555 shell \"hilog -x\" | grep -E \"AudioPlayUtils|Cannot Find Host|NET_ERR|EfAVPlayer\" | cut -c1-140 | tail -4; cd .. && rm -rf logs/reports logs/tmp_hypium","description":"Play full-length song and sample progress over time"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\nsamples: [(15.2, ['0:07 / 4:38']), (19.9, ['0:12 / 4:38']), (24.5, ['0:17 / 4:38'])]\n10-19 10:01:59.101 20910 20910 I A01010/Cloud Music: [AudioPlayUtils] 播放器初始化完成\n10-19 10:01:59.102 20910 20910 I A01010/Cloud Music: [AudioPlayUtils] 开始播放: http://m801.music.126.net/20261019102659/d88a503ea9b4664\n","metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"cmcu2h","output":"samples: [(15.2, ['0:07 / 4:38']), (19.9, ['0:12 / 4:38']), (24.5, ['0:17 / 4:38'])]\n10-19 10:01:59.101 20910 20910 I A01010/Cloud Music: [AudioPlayUtils] 播放器初始化完成\n10-19 10:01:59.102 20910 20910 I A01010/Cloud Music: [AudioPlayUtils] 开始播放: http://m801.music.126.net/20261019102659/d88a503ea9b4664\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},{"id":"6ad57a313e412730c69cbcdb","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":20810},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"ca3fea04-8773-4904-86a9-f32a211ca6a4","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Progress now moves smoothly from 0:07 to 0:17 and audio plays without the DNS error, so the issue seems resolved for the moment. The likely cause isn't the API address change since audio URLs are external CDN links, but rather the host network IP shift fixing the emulator's DNS for media. Still, ping continues to fail, suggesting a different resolver path, so this fix is environment-dependent and could recur if the network changes again.\n\nSeek itself can't be verified since there's no seek UI yet, though streaming an HTTP mp3 should support it. I also notice some songs are VIP trial tracks limited to 30 seconds even though total duration shows longer — this matters for testing seek-to-second-half scenarios, since seeking past a 30s trial boundary would fail or complete early. I should recommend using the player's actual prepared duration as the slider max rather than the song's listed duration, and flag that full-length (non-trial) songs should be used for self-tests — though this is an unconfirmed design decision I'd need to raise before updating any docs.\n\nGiven the user only asked a question, I'll answer directly and offer to update the baseline notes and acceptance criteria with this trial-clip finding, since that matches their earlier pattern of verifying before documenting. I'll leave the emulator playback running since it's harmless.\n\n","startTime":1792375351942,"lastModifiedTime":1792375365959},{"id":"2e43c442-d3b7-43b1-a106-6fe23e208a0e","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"本地\"音频播不出来\"这个问题现在不存在了，但不是改 API 地址解决的。\"跳转后同步\"本地还没验证。\n\n**实测结果**：刚才搜索\"晴天\"，播放 `晴天(深情版)`，然后打开右上角的播放弹窗，每隔约 4.5 秒读一次进度：\n- `0:07 / 4:38`\n- `0:12 / 4:38`\n- `0:17 / 4:38`\n\n进度在正常增长，日志里也没有之前那条 `IO Cannot Find Host 5411001` 报错了。\n\n**还没解决、要注意的地方**\n\n1. **原因没确认**。音频地址仍然是外网的 `m801.music.126.net`，API 改成 `10.0.2.2` 只影响搜索、取播放地址这类接口请求，跟音频本身无关。模拟器里 `ping m802.music.126.net` 到现在还是报 `Try again`，但播放器这次能拉到音频。我推测和电脑换了网络有关（IP 从 `192.168.1.97` 变成了 `172.24.16.249`），没有验证。所以换网络后这个问题可能还会出现。每次自测前，先播一首歌，确认进度在走。\n2. **\"跳转后同步\"本地还没法验证**。基线里没有进度条，也没有跳转功能，只能等开发出来再测。不过音频能正常播放了，验证跳转的前提已经有了。\n3. **新发现：有些歌只能试听 30 秒**。比如 `夜曲`（歌手 Xai小爱，id 2725685941），接口只返回 30 秒的试听片段（`freeTrialInfo.end=30`），而界面显示的总时长是 `3:53`。实测进度走到 `0:30` 就停住了。用这种歌测\"拖到后半段\"，会直接跳到片段之外。\n   - 自测要挑完整的歌，即接口返回里 `freeTrialInfo` 为 null 的，比如 `晴天(深情版)`。\n   - 实现上要决定一件事：进度条的最大值用歌曲信息里的时长，还是用播放器实际加载到的时长。我倾向于用后者，前者作备用。这一条应该作为新的待确认项加进验收矩阵。\n\n文档里现在仍写着\"音频播不出来\"。需要的话，我把 [`baseline-notes.md`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/spec/baseline-notes.md) §7 和 [`acceptance.md`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102/spec/acceptance.md) §0 里这条风险改成\"当前可以播放，但跟网络环境有关\"，再把试听片段这个风险和待确认项一起补进去。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1792375366163},{"id":"fc24307a-ba82-4908-9476-d434fd526e6f","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"补充吧。另外进度条的最大值肯定好似歌曲信息时常，而不是播放器加载到的时常","payload":{"query":"补充吧。另外进度条的最大值肯定好似歌曲信息时常，而不是播放器加载到的时常","rawMessage":"补充吧。另外进度条的最大值肯定好似歌曲信息时常，而不是播放器加载到的时常","model":{"displayName":"opus 5.5","modelId":"Opus 5.5_143_69ecd21d3a3e213032bd925cfe9637c5","requestType":"COMATE_MULTIPLE_MODE","mod